          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "425c2ec175b8277fdde1cee5eb68bb9ed1026832758b7868612de5f35267b51d",
          "excerpt": "甲申，以衛國夫人韓氏為淑妃，燕國夫人伊氏為德妃，仍令所司擇日冊命。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v032",
